        "created_at": "2018-08-28T14:46:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I may have missed something basic in the rules when I read them last night but heroes go to their incapacitated side with rewards underneath and then you add a new hero to the game correct?  So the incap heroes keep acting? Thus youd have in a 4 man game 4 active heroes plus any incapped heroes also acting?</p>\n<p>Im assuming they stay active since rewards are available under their character card if they are revived.</p>\n<p>Assuming I havent made a fatal error in my logic then does that mean a 4 man game with an incapped hero that gets resurrected would essentially have a 5th hero?  I feel like im missing some key bits of info.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:46.927Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
