        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/{size}/1920_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-28T15:13:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Incapacitated Heroes stay in the same play area, and there is a special list Pre-Start of Turn actions every player can choose to do each turn. Most of them involve Mission cards, but one of them is ‘Use a single Incapacitated Ability in your play area”. So you have to decide if you want to use the Ability, or do Mission things.</p>",
